id: pmc-itemless-pending
title: Render git notes for itemless pending releases and refuse stale extraction
description: "Default pending-window git Dependencies notes without changing historical projection. Related companion class pm-cli-website-tbni and release failures pm-cli-website-mcrq. After green CI document pm-context 2026.11.1 recovery without dispatch, merge or release."
type: Issue
pm_format_version: 2
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-11-02T04:43:41.380Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-02T06:33:47.422Z"
author: codex-sol
comments[12]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-02T04:43:44.199Z",codex-sol,"Scope and links: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli-companion/blob/main/.agents/pm/issues/pm-cli-website-tbni.toon and https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli-companion/blob/main/.agents/pm/issues/pm-cli-website-mcrq.toon. Preserve historical output and existing release thresholds; add real-git regression and revert checks; open PR and wait for CI, then record recovery plan only."
  "2026-11-02T04:46:32.306Z",codex-sol,"Current origin/main already rejects missing requested sections with MissingRequestedReleaseError/MISSING_REQUESTED_RELEASE before output. Reuse that canonical selector and guard. Automatic git notes apply only to itemless pending tag windows; explicit true preserves Dependabot enrichment for history, explicit false disables notes. Plain version-only tracker generation does not infer a git range. Generic git subjects remain escaped literal text."
  "2026-11-02T04:50:36.691Z",codex-sol,"Focused source and extension verification: node --test test/itemless-pending.test.ts test/extension.test.ts passed 28 tests, zero skipped. Real-git cases cover Dependabot-only, generic workflow-pin-only, no commits, pending items plus commits, byte-identical historical windows, single-window cutoffs, pending --stdout --limit 1, and opt-out. Revert proof is wired into the existing lifecycle CI job."
  "2026-11-02T04:56:14.648Z",codex-sol,"Final focused verification passed 8/8 tests after adding recorded-hash fallback for an empty git subject. pm test --run --only-last --progress passed the source-only disposable revert proof: fixed 8 pass, fallback revert 4 fail, restored 8 pass; requested-release guard fixed 1 pass, guard removal 1 fail, restored 1 pass. Full release gate is still running at unchanged thresholds. No consumer repository edits are needed for the new default."
  "2026-11-02T04:58:27.219Z",codex-sol,"Opened https://github.com/unbraind/pm-changelog/pull/311 at 23fba9866b450673771242dbf929d72aea920e7a. PR links this item and its history plus companion pm-cli-website-tbni and pm-cli-website-mcrq. CI lifecycle and CodeQL queued; Semgrep running. Build, test typecheck and docstring gate passed: 39 files and 264 documented declarations. Wait for green CI before inspecting and recording pm-context recovery."
  "2026-11-02T05:24:30.349Z",codex-sol,"CI at 23fba9866b450673771242dbf929d72aea920e7a: lifecycle passed (https://github.com/unbraind/pm-changelog/actions/runs/41391251311/job/125102917149), CodeQL/codeql and Semgrep passed. Lifecycle log confirms our generator proof fixed/restored 8 pass and default revert 4 fail; CLI guard fixed/restored 1 pass and removal 1 fail. Node 22 and Node 26 jobs are running full npm and Bun gates. Sourcery skipped, Cubic neutral, Greptile trial ended: these provide no review approval."
  "2026-11-02T05:28:52.390Z",codex-sol,"The local pm-linked npm run release:check attempt reached its 2400-second timeout while existing native lifecycle and Unicode suites were active; assertion_failure=0, timeout=1. It is incomplete evidence. Increased only this new item's linked command timeout to 7200 seconds and rerun the identical release gate; package thresholds and commands are unchanged. CI lifecycle, CodeQL and Semgrep passed; Node 22/26 full gates are still running."
  "2026-11-02T05:43:03.069Z",codex-sol,"Diagnosed the preflight failures as stale local dependencies, not a feature regression or a demonstrated sandbox defect: installed pm-cli 2026.10.20, pm-ops 2026.10.19 and marked 18.1.1 disagreed with the lockfile. npm ci installed exact pm-cli 2026.10.27, pm-ops 2026.10.26 and marked 18.1.2; lockfile unchanged. The same isolated existing host/SDK test now passes directly and through the pinned pm runner on Node 26.13.0. Interrupted the invalid-install rerun; it is not passing evidence. Restart the unchanged full gate on the corrected install. CI npm gates on both Node 22 and Node 26 have passed; Bun gates are running."
  "2026-11-02T05:53:59.252Z",codex-sol,"Actual Git-base revert proof, in a disposable archive: git archive ff74b2c97752ec6d12c11de51d95f9fee0c4608c src package.json; copy the new regression file and shared git fixture, link the exact installed dependencies, run node --test test/itemless-pending.test.ts. Base: 8 tests, 3 pass, 5 fail, zero skips. Restore current src in the archive: 8 pass, zero fail/skips. Existing no-commit, item-bearing and history controls pass on the base; default rendering, single pending fallback, opt-out/help and empty-subject checks detect the full revert. CI Node 26 completed both npm and Bun release gates: 985/985 tests each, 0 skips, 28 measured source files with 100% lines/branches/functions; docstrings 264 declarations across 39 files; production audit 0 vulnerabilities. Job: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-changelog/actions/runs/41391251311/job/125110075165. Statements are not independently measured by this package's gate."
  "2026-11-02T06:01:50.032Z",codex-sol,"Initial code head 23fba9866b450673771242dbf929d72aea920e7a is green: lifecycle, test (22), test (26), CodeQL/codeql and Semgrep succeeded. Both Node jobs completed npm and Bun full gates with 985 tests, 985 pass, 0 fail/skips, 28 source files and 100% lines/branches/functions on every pass. Node 22 job https://github.com/unbraind/pm-changelog/actions/runs/41391251311/job/125110075105; Node 26 job https://github.com/unbraind/pm-changelog/actions/runs/41391251311/job/125110075165. Begin read-only pm-context recovery investigation now; no workflow dispatch, merge or release authorized."
  "2026-11-02T06:19:46.909Z",codex-sol,"Recovery plan and evidence recorded in this item's body after green CI. Verified the exact existing resume shell block in a disposable clone, including two-bullet extraction and refusal controls. A plain notes-only repair fails the pinned canonical check; the verified two-commit notes/receipt lineage keeps canonical CI unchanged and supplies a preserved main-ancestor recovery_notes_sha. All actual pm-context state remains unchanged. Future execution needs separate authorization."
  "2026-11-02T06:33:46.106Z",codex-sol,"Corrected-install local npm run release:check passed through the pinned pm runner on Node 26.13.0: 985/985 tests, 0 fail/skips; LCOV lines 8715/8715, branches 3156/3156, functions 566/566 across all 28 required source files; docstrings 264/264 declarations in 39 files; production audit 0 vulnerabilities; package/changelog/date/publish-attestation checks passed. Actual host argv proof also passed for both pm changelog generate and export: default exit 0 with git Dependencies, --no-dependency-updates exit 1 for the missing requested section. Earlier stale-install timeout/interrupted runs are not passing evidence; the corrected full run and green Node 22/26 npm/Bun CI replace them. The recovery plan remains unexecuted; item stays in_progress for orchestrator verification."
